    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton that downloads a glTF/GLB model from the URL encoded in the scanned QR code and loads it into the scene using GLTFast. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Shows a progress-bar popup during download and an error popup on failure. On success it sets PatentManager.Patent and transitions to StateMachine.States.MODEL_VIEW_STATE. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
